meta {
  name: List products
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  limit: 10
  ~sort: id
  ~order: desc
  ~search: a
  ~categoryId: 1
  ~category: books
  ~published: false
}

docs {
  # List products

  The store catalogue. Every product belongs to a category, returned inline as `category: { id, name, code }`.

  Returns one page of active products. Soft-deleted records never appear.

  ## Auth

  None. Public. An optional Bearer token of an `ADMIN` also returns **draft** products (`published: false`); without one — or with a non-admin, invalid or expired token, which is treated as no token rather than a 401 — drafts are hidden.

  ## Query parameters

  | Name | Type | Required | Notes |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `page` | integer | no | 1-based page; default 1. A page past the end returns `data: []` with correct `pagination`. |
  | `limit` | integer | no | Page size; default 10; values above 100 are clamped to 100. |
  | `sort` | string | no | One of: id, name, price, stock, createdAt. Default `id`. |
  | `order` | string | no | `asc` or `desc`; default `desc`. |
  | `search` | string | no | Case-insensitive match against: name, code, description. |
  | `categoryId` | integer | no | Only products in this category (by id). |
  | `category` | string | no | Only products in this category (by code, case-insensitive), e.g. `books`. |
  | `published` | `true` \| `false` | no | Admin token only: `false` lists drafts, `true` published products. Ignored for everyone else. |

  ## Responses

  ### 200 OK

    {
      "message": "Product list",
      "data": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "categoryId": 4,
          "name": "Beach Towel",
          "code": "beach-towel",
          "price": 24.95,
          "stock": 40,
          "img": [
            "https://picsum.photos/seed/lpa-beach-towel/640/640"
          ],
          "description": "Quick-dry towel for Gold Coast beaches.",
          "published": true,
          "category": {
            "id": 4,
            "name": "Sports",
            "code": "sports"
          },
          "created": {
            "client": "2026-09-27T02:30:14.000Z",
            "server": "2026-09-27T02:30:14.000Z",
            "serverDate": "2026-09-27",
            "serverTime": "12:30:14",
            "unixTime": 1790476214,
            "user": 1,
            "role": "ADMIN"
          },
          "updated": null,
          "statusName": "ACTIVE",
          "status": 1,
          "createdAt": "2026-09-27T02:30:14.000Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T02:30:14.000Z"
        }
      ],
      "pagination": {
        "total": 1,
        "page": 1,
        "limit": 10,
        "totalPages": 1,
        "count": 1,
        "hasNextPage": false,
        "hasPrevPage": false
      }
    }

  ### 400 Bad Request — validation failed

  A paging, sort or filter parameter is invalid (e.g. `page=0`, an unknown `sort`).

    {
      "message": "Some fields need attention.",
      "data": null,
      "pagination": null,
      "errors": [
        {
          "field": "page",
          "message": "Invalid input"
        }
      ]
    }

  Outside production, error bodies also carry `stack`.
}
